The COMFAST CF-E313AC is an outdoor 5 GHz 802.11ac wireless CPE.
It is based on the [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.qualcomm.ar71xx|Qualcomm QCA9531]] SoC, and features two RJ45 10/100 Mbps Ethernet ports, with PoE pass-through.
The QCA9886 radio chip provides a 900 Mbps 5 GHz 802.11a/an/ac radio connected to an internal 2T2R 12 dBi atenna.


